ging the files and information you use into one place. Create polished documents, presentations and spreadsheets, summarise articles and files, draft emails, brainstorm ideas, analyse information, and get insights based on the work you're doing.\n\nNeed help tackling a bigger task? With Cowork, Copilot can take on multi-step work and help deliver finished files and completed to-dos, so you spend less time piecing work together and more time making progress.\n\nChoose between leading AI models, and select the one that's best suited to the task at hand. Whether you're writing, researching, planning or analysing, Copilot gives you the flexibility to work your way.\n\nCopilot also remembers what matters, connects to the files and information you use most and helps you pick up where you left off. Upload Word, Excel, PowerPoint, images or PDF files directly from your phone to ask questions, generate summaries and find the information you need.\n\nFor organisations with a Microsoft 365 Copilot subscription, Work IQ affords Copilot a deep\nunderstanding of your organisation's work, people, and relationships, delivering more intelligent, relevant, personalised and trusted assistance.\n\nCopilot is built on the same enterprise-grade security foundation as Microsoft 365 — your permissions, encryption, and compliance commitments already in place. Data processing and protection commitments differ by subscription; see the full security documentation for more details.\nAvailability of Microsoft Copilot features may vary. Some capabilities require specific licences or may be disabled by your organisation's administrator. See this webpage for more information on feature availability by licence:\nhttps://support.microsoft.com/topic/understanding-the-different-microsoft-copilot-experiences-cfff4791-694a-4d90-9c9c-1eb3fb28e842\n\nPlease refer to Microsoft’s EULA for Terms of Service for Microsoft 365. By installing the app, you agree to these terms and conditions:\nhttps://learn.micros